{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"民数记","commonName":"民数记","title":"民数记","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"ba1ab46e42e784cde98e7b69dca91399dcc7d758951f802d5da0412989293c76","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":34,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["迦南的疆域"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“你把以下指示告诉以色列人。 “你们进入赐给你们作产业的迦南后，你们四境的疆界如下："]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["“南部疆界从荀旷野沿着以东边界延伸，东起死海的尽头，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["往南至亚克拉滨坡南面，经荀直到加低斯·巴尼亚南面，再延伸至哈萨·亚达，经押们，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["转向埃及河，直到地中海。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["“西部以地中海为界，这是你们西部的边界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["“北部疆界从地中海开始直到何珥山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["从何珥山再到哈马口，经西达达、"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["西斐仑直到哈萨·以难。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["“东部疆界从哈萨·以难一直划到示番，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["从示番往南到亚延东面的利比拉，再往南到基尼烈湖东岸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["然后沿约旦河南下直到死海。这是你们国土四面的疆界。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["摩西又对以色列人说：“这就是耶和华吩咐用抽签的方式分给你们九个半支派的土地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["吕便支派和迦得支派已经按着家系得到了他们的产业，玛拿西半个支派也得到了他们的产业。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["这两个半支派的产业在耶利哥对面的约旦河东岸。”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["分地的首领"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["“负责给你们分地的是以利亚撒祭司和嫩的儿子约书亚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["每支派要选出一位首领来协助分地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["“以下是这些首领的名字： 犹大支派耶孚尼的儿子迦勒，"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["西缅支派亚米忽的儿子示姆利，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["便雅悯支派基斯伦的儿子以利达，"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["但支派约利的儿子布基，"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["约瑟之子玛拿西支派以弗的儿子汉聂，"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["以法莲支派拾弗但的儿子基姆利，"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["西布伦支派帕纳的儿子以利撒番，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["以萨迦支派阿散的儿子帕铁，"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["亚设支派示罗米的儿子亚希忽，"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["拿弗他利支派亚米忽的儿子比达黑。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["这些是奉耶和华之命在迦南给以色列人分产业的首领。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/34.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/35.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/33.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}